 {
  "en": "Your ravenous growth is causing destruction in the omniverse, creature. As the high<br>&#8202;&#8202;ruler of this section of the omniverse, I command you to cease immediately.",
  "ids": [
   "s1019"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "&#8202;&#8202;End your mindless chaos and destruction this instant! You have no idea what you're doing to the fabric of reality!",
  "ids": [
   "s1020"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "Another greedy soul. You will be disposed of, like all those that came before you.",
  "ids": [
   "s1021"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "I wish you would reconsider your actions. ...I suppose it's too late for that now though. The fighting won't stop until either you're gone or all of us are.",
  "ids": [
   "s1022"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "Ogghh. You dare wake me from my slumber? This better be important, mortal creature.",
  "ids": [
   "s1023"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "&#8202;&#8202;Nuh uh!",
  "ids": [
   "s1024"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "You! Can you even begin to fathom the utter destruction you've caused!? The fabric of spacetime is imploding, trillions upon trillions dead under your ignorant foot, and for<br>&#8202;&#8202;what!? I implore you to cease this, organic being!",
  "ids": [
   "s1025"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "&#8202;&#8202;Hey mate, not cool, what you're doing. You better back off, bud.",
  "ids": [
   "s1026"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "You think you can surpass my power? I will crush you like the insignificant being you<br>&#8202;&#8202;are!",
  "ids": [
   "s1027"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "&#8202;&#8202;Bringer of destruction. It is clear I cannot stop you, but I have no choice but to try.<br>&#8202;&#8202;Because there's no telling what will happen to the omniverse if you continue.",
  "ids": [
   "s1028"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "You've killed off my bretheren, but the worst is yet to come for you! I'll show you the true power of the hypergods!",
  "ids": [
   "s1029"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "&#8202;&#8202;Well, I think that's that. I am the last remaining hypergod. Destroyer of gods, ruler of<br>&#8202;&#8202;everything, the omniverse is now yours and yours alone. Farewell.",
  "ids": [
   "s1030"
  ]
 },
